{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Cozbi daughter of Zur.</b> She was a king's daughter, for Zur was one of the five kings of Midian, as it says (Numbers 31): ״את אוי ואת רקם ואת צור ואת חור ואת רבע חמשת מלכי מדין״ — 'Evi and Rekem and Zur and Hur and Reba, the five kings of Midian,' etc. And because of the hatred of the Midianites toward Israel, they were willing to declare a king's daughter permitted to harlotry in order to make them sin."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:36:07.133849540Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}